      "note": "Five linear feet at Syracuse: correspondence with Balanchine, Boulanger, Colette, Chavez, de Mille, Hurok, Romola Nijinsky, Reinhardt, Stokowski and Stravinsky, some of it in Russian and French; his own writings and notes; radio interviews, scrapbooks, 16mm films and phonograph records. Not a book, because no book was written — this is the material one would be written from.",
