      "url": "https://archive.batsheva.co.il/en/people/ohad-naharin/",
      "note": "The company's own archive site, in Hebrew and English. Naharin's page runs from Kibbutz Mizra and the IDF band through Graham pulling him to New York, the Bat-Dor and Ailey and Béjart seasons, and every piece he made for Batsheva, each work linked to its own record with cast, posters, programmes and press. The physical collection it draws on is deposited in the Israeli Dance Archive at Beit Ariela, Tel Aviv. Nothing outside Israel holds this.",
