      "note": "Thirty-seven minutes cut from seven months of Halprin's workshops with a group of San Francisco men with AIDS or HIV, ending in their performance of Carry Me Home. It is the clearest record of how she actually runs a group — what she asks for, and what she does with what comes back.",
      "src": "Open Eye Pictures, the producer's own film page"
