      "note": "Twenty-six pages of Halprin questioned by her own former student, printed while the workshop that produced Judson was still recent. Tulane Drama Review 10:2, Winter 1965, pp. 142-167. Published under the name she used then, Ann. Paywalled; the abstract page carries the full citation.",
