      "note": "Cecelia Gable's profile, written while Dunn was alive and in a wheelchair from a brain tumour, and quoting her at length: dice tossed just before stepping onto the Judson stage to fix the order of phrases, another dance charted by a system built on friends' telephone numbers, and improvisation defined as composing and performing simultaneously. The host, her former Bennington student Penny Campbell, says plainly she is not sure where or whether it was published.",
