      "note": "The Centre Pompidou's page for the film day of the 2009 Grotowski Year, made with the Grotowski Institute, the Collège de France and the Bouffes du Nord. It survives as a short annotated filmography in French of the four essential films — the Wethal training film, Ahrne's last interview film, Drot's 1967 Wrocław film and McTaggart's Akropolis with Peter Brook's introduction — with dates, lengths and language versions.",
      "src": "Centre Pompidou, agenda archive"
