 "laquica": {
  "born": "Spain",
  "place": "Seville, Andalusia",
  "note": "Born in Seville, not Madrid. The map's paragraph calls her 'a Madrid dance teacher', which is where she worked — her academy stood at Plaza General Vara del Rey and she died in Madrid in 1967 — but both accessible sources make her Sevillian by birth. EcuRed adds that she danced in tablaos as a child and toured Spanish provinces with her husband Frasquillo before the teaching years.",
  "src": "EcuRed, 'La Quica' (ecured.cu/La_Quica) — 'Nacida en Sevilla en 1905, su nombre verdadero era Francisca González Martínez'; corroborated by Flamencas por Derecho, 'La Quica, maestría y temperamento (I)' — 'Francisca González Martínez, bailaora sevillana nacida en 1905'"
 },
