  "place": "Chicago, Illinois",
  "note": "Chicago to Los Angeles. Born and raised in Chicago — in Cabrini-Green on the Near North Side, by a single mother from the age of three — and his family moved to the Los Angeles area in the 1970s, where he started dancing in clubs around Crenshaw Boulevard and at Radiotron and joined The Lockers.",
