  "src": "en.wikipedia, Aditi Mangaldas — 'Born in 1960, Aditi Mangaldas was brought up in Ahmedabad, where she completed her Bachelor of Science from St. Xavier's College... She started training in Kathak dance under Kumudini Lakhia at Kadamb Centre for Dance in Ahmedabad'"
